              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بامداد (bâmdâd) — \"early morning, the small hours\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "زلزله ساعت چهار بامداد اتفاق افتاد. Zelzele sâ'at-e chahâr-e bâmdâd ettefâq oftâd. The earthquake happened at four in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The news gives night-time hours with bâmdâd: sâ'at-e se-ye bâmdâd \"3 a.m.\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bâmdâd is inherited from Middle Persian bāmdād, \"dawn, morning\" (EtymDB)."
