              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هنگام (hengâm) — \"the time, the season (formal); at the time of\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هنگام (hengâm) غروب به ساحل رسیدیم. Hengâm-e ghorub be sâhel residim. We reached the beach at sunset."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal, with the ezafe: hengâm-e shâm \"at dinner time\". Hengâmi ke \"when\" opens a clause."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "hengâm is a native Persian word. EtymDB lists it without a parent, and its deeper origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
